LAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2796066466,"text":"ここは竺子の家？","nextNodeIds":[728020206]},{"nodeId":728020206,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3050,"speakerName":"曜","textMapHash":4013777882,"text":"そうだが、何か用か？","nextNodeIds":[728020207]},{"nodeId":728020207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3649821170,"text":"竺子から頼まれた手紙を届けに来た。","nextNodeIds":[728020208]},{"nodeId":728020208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3049,"speakerName":"満","textMapHash":4108861346,"text":"手紙？どうして急に手紙を…","nextNodeIds":[728020209]},{"nodeId":728020209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3049,"speakerName":"満","textMapHash":1088332850,"text":"しかもこんなに長い…もう家に帰ってるんだから、言いたいことがあったら直接言えばいいのに。","nextNodeIds":[728020210,728020211]},{"nodeId":728020210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1298373010,"text":"…え？","nextNodeIds":[728020212]},{"nodeId":728020212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3049,"speakerName":"満","textMapHash":2775445522,"text":"その…旅人、驚いているみたいね。うちの竺子はしばらく旅をしていたけど、今は家にいるのよ。","nextNodeIds":[728020213]},{"nodeId":728020213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3049,"speakerName":"満","textMapHash":1198843322,"text":"帰っているのに、わざわざ人にお願いして手紙を送るわけないわ。人違いじゃないかしら？","nextNodeIds":[728020214]},{"nodeId":728020214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3050,"speakerName":"曜","textMapHash":3937254874,"text":"ちょっと、母ちゃん。少し読んだけど、この筆跡と言葉遣いは、確かにうちの娘だ。","nextNodeIds":[728020215]},{"nodeId":728020215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3050,"speakerName":"曜","textMapHash":2172933810,"text":"手紙にも、すぐに戻る予定はないから、元気でいてくれって書いてある。","nextNodeIds":[728020216]},{"nodeId":728020216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3049,"speakerName":"満","textMapHash":2981205826,"text":"どういうこと？あの子、旅人に手紙を頼んでいながら、こっそり帰ってきたの？","nextNodeIds":[728020217]},{"nodeId":728020217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3050,"speakerName":"曜","textMapHash":3026066698,"text":"とにかく誤解があるみたいだ。彼女が帰ってきたら聞いてみよう。","nextNodeIds":[728020218]},{"nodeId":728020218,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3050,"speakerName":"曜","textMapHash":2947770,"text":"旅人、あいにくうちの竺子は用事で外出してるんだ。戻ってきたらしっかり聞いてみるよ。","nextNodeIds":[728020219]},{"nodeId":728020219,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3050,"speakerName":"曜","textMapHash":3314946618,"text":"もしよかったら、夜にも一度来てくれないか。竺子に説明してもらう。","nextNodeIds":[728020220,728020222]},{"nodeId":728020220,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2686473058,"text":"いま彼女はどこに？","nextNodeIds":[728020221]},{"nodeId":728020221,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3050,"speakerName":"曜","textMapHash":2808526634,"text":"仕事で忙しいって、夕飯の後に急に出て行った。","nextNodeIds":[728020224]},{"nodeId":728020224,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3049,"speakerName":"満","textMapHash":3564863450,"text":"ええ、あの子は毎日早く出かけて夜遅く帰ってくるの。夜しか会えないから、一体何をしているのか分からないわ。","nextNodeIds":[728020225]},{"nodeId":728020225,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3050,"speakerName":"曜","textMapHash":1075664858,"text":"とにかく、明日の夜に来てくれ。あの子が間違っていたら、直接謝ってもらう。","nextNodeIds":[728020226]},{"nodeId":728020226,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3049,"speakerName":"満","textMapHash":2803493714,"text":"遥々遠くから来たのに、ごめんなさいね。","nextNodeIds":[728020227]},{"nodeId":728020227,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3050,"speakerName":"曜","textMapHash":471521610,"text":"竺子のやつ、世話が焼けるんだから…","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":728020222,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3200929514,"text":"どうして夜なの？","nextNodeIds":[728020223]},{"nodeId":728020223,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3050,"speakerName":"曜","textMapHash":2184041634,"text":"仕事で忙しいって、毎日、昼にご飯を食べ終わると急に出ていくんだ。","nextNodeIds":[728020224]},{"nodeId":728020211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3683773962,"text":"竺子…帰ってるの？","nextNodeIds":[728020212]},{"nodeId":728020205,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":365518