"dialogs":[{"nodeId":728020501,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1494448338,"text":"竺子たちは家にいるはずだ。ノックしてみよう。","nextNodeIds":[728020502]},{"nodeId":728020502,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2974804194,"text":"何か話しているみたい。","nextNodeIds":[728020503]},{"nodeId":728020503,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3049,"speakerName":"満","textMapHash":1682751802,"text":"そういえば、以前保護した狸、今の様子はどう？","nextNodeIds":[728020504]},{"nodeId":728020504,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3050,"speakerName":"曜","textMapHash":3091674226,"text":"お前は優しいな。あの狸の傷は小さなもんだ。草むらにおいて行っても、自分で治せるだろう。","nextNodeIds":[728020505]},{"nodeId":728020505,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3049,"speakerName":"満","textMapHash":89046962,"text":"だってかわいそうだから。私、見ているだけで涙が出ちゃった。放っておくわけにはいかないわ。","nextNodeIds":[728020506]},{"nodeId":728020506,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3050,"speakerName":"曜","textMapHash":3347263690,"text":"まあ、良いことだし、面倒を見てやろうか。ただ、こいつはちょっと食べすぎだな。俺と同じくらい食べるぞ…","nextNodeIds":[728020507]},{"nodeId":728020507,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2005939298,"text":"門をノックする","nextNodeIds":[728020508]},{"nodeId":728020508,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3050,"speakerName":"曜","textMapHash":3039264658,"text":"誰だ？","nextNodeIds":[728020509]},{"nodeId":728020509,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1951363066,"text":"この前の旅人だ。","nextNodeIds":[728020510]},{"nodeId":728020510,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3050,"speakerName":"曜","textMapHash":776641114,"text":"ああ、この前の旅人か、ちょっと待っててくれ。","nextNodeIds":[728020511]},{"nodeId":728020511,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20307,"speakerName":"竺子","textMapHash":2117573098,"text":"こ、こんにちは！私は竺子です、はじめ…いえ…また会いましたね！","nextNodeIds":[728020512]},{"nodeId":728020512,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20307,"speakerName":"竺子","textMapHash":2157220898,"text":"ごめんなさい、家を恋しく思い過ぎて、手紙を渡した後にまた心が変わって、船で家に帰ってきちゃった。","nextNodeIds":[728020513]},{"nodeId":728020513,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20307,"speakerName":"竺子","textMapHash":307787282,"text":"あはは…だから全部誤解だったの。ごめんなさい、遠くからわざわざ来てくれたのに。","nextNodeIds":[728020514]},{"nodeId":728020514,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3099505722,"text":"稲妻に帰る方法があったの？","nextNodeIds":[728020515]},{"nodeId":728020515,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20307,"speakerName":"竺子","textMapHash":759433714,"text":"それは…個人的な方法があるの。気にしないで。","nextNodeIds":[728020516]},{"nodeId":728020516,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20307,"speakerName":"竺子","textMapHash":2444654642,"text":"その、報酬は準備してあるから、受け取って。手伝ってくれてありがとう！じゃあ…あなたたちも忙しいと思うから、早く仕事に戻ってね。","nextNodeIds":[728020517]},{"nodeId":728020517,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3697796274,"text":"竺子の話って矛盾してないか？稲妻に簡単に行き来できるんなら、始めっからどうしてオイラたちに頼んだんだ？","nextNodeIds":[728020518,728020520]},{"nodeId":728020518,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2224309658,"text":"璃月でのビジネスは？","nextNodeIds":[728020519]},{"nodeId":728020519,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20307,"speakerName":"竺子","textMapHash":2871335938,"text":"ビジネス？なんのビジネス？私って璃月にビジネスがあったの！？","nextNodeIds":[728020522]},{"nodeId":728020522,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20307,"speakerName":"竺子","textMapHash":1712833186,"text":"…ああ、そういうのはただの財産で、家族に比べれば全くどうでもいいことよ。もう他の人に任せてあるの…はは。","nextNodeIds":[728020523]},{"nodeId":728020523,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1551669538,"text":"おいおい、本当の竺子は璃月で仕事を探すだけでも精いっぱいなのに、一瞬でお金持ちになったのか？","nextNodeIds":[728020524]},{"nodeId":728020524,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3547157250,"text":"#{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BOYSECOND|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_GIRLSECOND]}はいったい何者？","nextNodeIds":[728020525]},{"nodeId":728020525,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20307,"speakerName":"竺子","textMapHash":3190225762,"text":"も…もちろん竺子だよ！見た目は竺子、声も竺子。疑うところなんてないよ！","nextNodeIds":[728020526]},{"nodeId":728020526,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20307,"speakerName":"竺子","textMapHash":2407957114,"text":"あなたねぇ！ちょっとしつこい…まあいいわ。明日も仕事があるから、とりあえず帰るね。","nextNodeIds":[728020527]},{"nodeId":728020527,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3049,"speakerName":"満","textMapHash":1740261850,"text":"あら、竺子！あの子ったら…急に怒り出しちゃって…","nextNodeIds":[728020528]},{"nodeId":728020528,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3050,"speakerName":"曜","textMapHash":647858514,"text":"旅人、すまない。あの子、きっと仕事で疲れてるんだ。","nextNodeIds":[728020529]},{"nodeId":728020529,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3050,"speakerName":"曜","textMapHash":3245963178,"text":"でも見た通り、確かに俺たちの娘だ。お前さんが持ってきた手紙について…彼女は本当に忘れてしまったのかもしれない。","nextNodeIds":[728020530]},{"nodeId":728020530,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3050,"speakerName":"曜","textMapHash":4128481466,"text":"いずれにせよ、助けてくれたことは感謝する。報酬は…もう少し待ってくれないか？","nextNodeIds":[728020531,728020532]},{"nodeId":728020531,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":520610458,"text":"何かあったの？","nextNodeIds":[728020533]},{"nodeId":728020533,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3050,"speakerName":"曜","textMapHash":1586845986,"text":"そんなことない。報酬くらい問題ないぞ。","nextNodeIds":[728020534]},{"nodeId":728020534,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3050,"speakerName":"曜","textMapHash":978760298,"text":"竺子のやつ、昼は仕事してるだろ？だが、彼女が毎日持って帰る給料がなんかおかしいんだ。","nextNodeIds":[728020535]},{"nodeId":728020535,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3050,"speakerName":"曜","textMapHash":1727330482,"text":"いつも変な種や果物とかで、モラを持って帰ったことは一度もない。","nextNodeIds":[728020536]},{"nodeId":728020536,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3050,"speakerName":"曜","textMapHash":3616974306,"text":"あれも金にはなるが、売りに行く必要がある。","nextNodeIds":[728020537]},{"nodeId":728020537,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3050,"speakerName":"曜","textMapHash":217995963